      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Each hex is 8 cm point to point. The hex grid is planned on paper before starting so the column and row counts sit correctly for each size."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Motif count guide"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "At size M the front and back panels each use approximately 56 full hexagons (8 columns x 7 rows) plus 8 half hexagons along the hem. Each sleeve uses approximately 28 full hexagons plus 4 half hexagons. Total motifs at size M: approximately 160 full and 20 half hexagons."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Increase or decrease the number of columns per panel to adjust width. Add or remove rows to adjust length."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
