        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Working the hex grid"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work the first row of hexagons separately. On each subsequent row, join each new hexagon to its neighbours on the final round using join as you go. Work back-to-front panels separately then seam at shoulder and sides. Attach sleeve panels at the armholes and seam sleeve edges."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work one round of dc around the neckline, picking up one dc per edge segment of each hex at the neck opening. Fasten off and weave in all ends."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
